   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{2θ is in quadrant IV, so sin 2θ is}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{negative.}\\\\[5pt]&\\sin2\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{14400}{28561}}=-\\dfrac{119}{169}\\end{aligned}\\]",
