   "title": "Quadrant of θ",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Assume 0° $<$ 2θ $<$ 360°, so 0° $<$ θ $<$ 180°}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{and sin θ is positive.}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{2θ in quadrant IV means θ is in quadrant}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{II: sin positive, cos negative.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
