   "title": "sin θ and cos θ",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\sin\\theta=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1-\\frac{120}{169}}2}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{49}{338}}=\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{\\dfrac{7\\sqrt2}{26}}}\\\\[5pt]&\\cos\\theta=-\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1+\\frac{120}{169}}2}=-\\sqrt{\\dfrac{289}{338}}=\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{-\\dfrac{17\\sqrt2}{26}}}\\end{aligned}\\]",
